And there she was...

5
00:01:48.260 --> 00:01:49.440
Hello.

6
00:01:51.230 --> 00:01:52.650
Riley.

7
00:01:53.220 --> 00:01:57.030
Look at you. Aren't you a little bundle of Joy?

8
00:02:07.920 --> 00:02:10.160
Aren't you a little bundle of Joy?

9
00:02:30.170 --> 00:02:35.160
It was amazing. Just Riley and me. Forever.

10
00:02:41.400 --> 00:02:43.930
Er, for 33 seconds?

11
00:02:45.920 --> 00:02:47.670
I'm sadness.

12
00:02:47.780 --> 00:02:51.290
Hello. I... I'm Joy. So...

13
00:02:51.540 --> 00:02:55.430
Can I just... if you could... I just want to fix that. Thanks.

14
00:02:55.460 --> 00:02:57.230
And that was just the beginning.

15
