Okay, caution. There is a dangerous smell, people.

26
00:03:30.050 --> 00:03:31.050
Hold on. What is that?

27
00:03:31.060 --> 00:03:32.260
This is disgust.

28
00:03:32.260 --> 00:03:34.960
She basically keeps Riley from being poisoned.

29
00:03:34.960 --> 00:03:36.210
Physically and socially.

30
00:03:36.210 --> 00:03:38.450
That is not brightly colored or shaped like a dinosaur.

31
00:03:38.450 --> 00:03:39.520
Hold on, guys.

32
00:03:39.520 --> 00:03:40.930
It's broccoli!

33
00:03:41.190 --> 00:03:42.410
Yucky!

34
00:03:43.730 --> 00:03:46.570
Well, I just saved our lives. Yeah. You're welcome.

35
00:03:46.570 --> 00:03:48.140
Riley, if you don't eat your dinner,

36
00:03:48.150 --> 00:03:49.520
