Look out, mermaid!

72
00:06:03.250 --> 00:06:04.770
Lava!

73
00:06:06.540 --> 00:06:10.350
Who's your friend who likes to play? Bing bong, bing bong!

74
00:06:10.640 --> 00:06:12.940
