75
00:06:17.680 --> 00:06:19.360
Brain freeze!

76
00:06:25.970 --> 00:06:27.070
Yeah!

77
00:06:30.080 --> 00:06:32.500
- Good night, kiddo.  - Good night, dad.

78
00:06:37.680 --> 00:06:40.630
