107
00:08:28.590 --> 00:08:31.090
What! Let's review the top five daydreams.

108
00:08:31.090 --> 00:08:32.880
- That looks safe!  - That one's nice.

109
00:08:32.880 --> 00:08:35.420
This will be great for Riley! No, no, no, no, this one!

110
