240
00:13:57.960 --> 00:14:01.250
Yeah. Find the fun. I don't know how to do that.

241
00:14:01.250 --> 00:14:04.340
Okay. Well, try to think of something funny.

242
00:14:05.630 --> 00:14:08.590
Remember the funny movie where the dog dies?

243
00:14:08.590 --> 00:14:10.590
Yeah, that's not...

244
00:14:10.590 --> 00:14:12.300
What about that time with Meg

245
00:14:12.300 --> 00:14:16.560
