01:13:43.420 --> 01:13:46.240
Riley? Riley!

1298
01:13:50.510 --> 01:13:52.030
I'll call her cell.

1299
01:13:56.010 --> 01:13:57.950
This is terrible. Wait, is that someone walking towards us?

1300
01:13:57.970 --> 01:13:59.240
Yep, let's cross the street.

1301
01:14:04.020 --> 01:14:05.490
It's mom. She's onto us!

1302
01:14:05.520 --> 01:14:06.860
- What do we do?  - Where's my bag?

1303
01:14:06.860 --> 01:14:08.400
Riley needs to get Core Memories.

1304
01:14:08.400 --> 01:14:10.040
- That's the stuff.  - We keep going.

1305
01:14:12.950 --> 01:14:14.600
Sadness!

1306
01:14:25.040 --> 01:14:27.170
Sadness! Sadness?

1307
01:14:27.210 --> 01:14:29.680
Come on, Sadness. Where are you?

1308
01:14:29.710 --> 01:14:32.260
Okay. If I were Sadness, where would I be?

1309
01:14:33.930 --> 01:14:37.600
Everything is awful and my legs don't work,

1310
01:14:37.600 --> 01:14:40.990
and you have to drag me around while I touch all the...

1311
01:14:56.280 --> 01:14:58.000
Oh, no! It's mom again! What do we do?

1312
01:15:05.420 --> 01:15:07.420
This is madness! She shouldn't run away!

1313
01:15:07.420 --> 01:15:08.970
Let's get this idea out of her head.

1314
01:15:09.920 --> 01:15:11.090
Sadness?

1315
01:15:13.260 --> 01:15:15.810
- Sadness!  - Joy?

1316
01:15:16.550 --> 01:15:17.470
Wait! Sadness!

1317
01:15:18.140 --> 01:15:22.200
Just let me go! Riley's better off without me!

1318
01:15:22.220 --> 01:15:23.270
Come back!

1319
01:15:28.560 --> 01:15:32.200
Okay, you're saying your husband was blown away by an elephant.

1320
01:15:32.230 --> 01:15:33.320
Was he with anyone?

1321
01:15:33.360 --> 01:15:34.780
Yes! And there she is!

1322
01:15:34.780 --> 01:15:36.250
Hey! Come back here!

1323
01:15:36.280 --> 01:15:38.490
Forget it, Jake. It's Cloud Town.

1324
01:15:42.290 --> 01:15:43.800
What? Sadness!

1325
01:15:44.700 --> 01:15:47.210
I only make everything worse!

1326
01:15:47.250 --> 01:15:49.520
Wait! Sadness! We got to get you back to...

1327
01:15:59.640 --> 01:16:01.240
- It's stuck!  - Great.

1328
01:16:01.260 --> 01:16:03.560
- What do you mean it's stuck?  - Now what?

1329
01:16:03.600 --> 01:16:05.280
Oh, no no no no! What is this?

1330
01:16:14.320 --> 01:16:15.860
- How do we stop it?  - I got it!

1331
01:16:15.860 --> 01:16:17.620
Make her feel scared! That'll make her change her mind!

1332
01:16:17.650 --> 01:16:19.740
- Brilliant!  - I know it's brilliant! Do it!

1333
01:16:19.780 --> 01:16:21.870
Nothing's working! Why isn't it working?

1334
01:16:21.870 --> 01:16:22.420
- Let me try.  - Great! You broke it!

1335
01:16:22.490 --> 01:16:23.580
- No, I didn't!  - Don't touch that!

1336
01:16:23.660 --> 01:16:24.870
- Let me do it!  - Get out of here!

1337
01:16:29.500 --> 01:16:32.970
Guys, we can't make Riley feel anything.

1338
01:16:33.840 --> 01:16:35.560
What have we done?

1339
01:16:36.340 --> 01:16:39.470
Hey! Hey, look at me! Did you mean what you said before?

1340
01:16:39.510 --> 01:16:41.930
I would die for Riley! I would die for Riley!

1341
01:16:41.970 --> 01:16:43.680
Yeah, okay, haircut. Time to prove it.

1342
01:16:47.520 --> 01:16:49.410
I would die for Riley! I would die for Riley!

1343
01:16:49.440 --> 01:16:52.040
I would die for Riley!

1344
01:17:07.700 --> 01:17:09.330
That's it! I fold!

1345
01:17:40.320 --> 01:17:44.500
This is crazy. This is crazy. No, no, no. Joy. Be positive.

1346
01:17:48.200 --> 01:17:50.170
I am positive this is crazy!

1347
01:17:54.040 --> 01:17:56.970
- Now!  - For Riley!

1348
01:18:04.260 --> 01:18:06.480
- Joy?  - Hang on!

1349
01:18:07.600 --> 01:18:09.820
I wish Joy was here!

1350
01:18:16.980 --> 01:18:18.400
It's Joy!

1351
01:18:19.280 --> 01:18:20.540
Stand back!

1352
01:18:21.700 --> 01:18:22.580
That worked.

1353
01:18:22.610 --> 01:18:24.240
Well, what would you do, if you're so smart?

1354
01:18:25.120 --> 01:18:27.920
I'd tell you, but you're too dumb to understand.

1355
01:18:27.950 --> 01:18:28.910
What?

1356
01:18:28.950 --> 01:18:30.750
Of course your tiny brain is confused.

1357
01:18:30.790 --> 01:18:33.660
Guess I'll just have to dumb it down to your level.

1358
01:18:33.670 --> 01:18:38.020
Sorry I don't speak moron as well as you, but let me try. Duh!

1359
01:18:47.640 --> 01:18:48.970
Thank Goodness you're back!

1360
01:18:48.970 --> 01:18:50.970
- Things are really messed up!  - We found this idea.

1361
01:18:50.970 --> 01:18:52.900
We were just trying to make happy memories.

1362
01:19:02.900 --> 01:19:04.450
Joy, you got to fix this! Get up there!

1363
01:19:04.490 --> 01:19:06.210
Sadness, it's up to you.

1364
01:19:06.240 --> 01:19:08.540
- Me?  - Sadness?

1365
01:19:08.580 --> 01:19:09.800
I can't, Joy.

1366
01:19:09.830 --> 01:19:12.470
Yes, you can. Riley needs you.

1367
01:19:24.340 --> 01:19:25.550
Okay.

1368
01:19:46.150 --> 01:19:48.830
Wait! Stop! I want to get off!

1369
01:20:00.420 --> 01:20:02.140
All right. Thank you. We will.

1370
01:20:02.170 --> 01:20:03.760
Her teacher hasn't even seen Riley all day.

1371
01:20:03.840 --> 01:20:04.770
- What?  - What was she wearing last?

1372
01:20:05.050 --> 01:20:06.480
- Do you even remember what...  - I can't believe this.

1373
01:20:08.010 --> 01:20:09.850
Riley, there you are! Thank Goodness!

1374
01:20:09.890 --> 01:20:12.320
We were worried sick! Where have you been? It's so late!

1375
01:21:44.270 --> 01:21:47.490
I know you don't want me to but...

1376
01:21:48.820 --> 01:21:50.210
I miss home.

1377
01:21:52.030 --> 01:21:53.700
I miss Minnesota.

1378
01:21:57.080 --> 01:22:00.340
You need me to be happy, but...

1379
01:22:02.040 --> 01:22:06.470
I want my old friends, and my hockey team.

1380
01:22:08.590 --> 01:22:10.400
I want to go home.

1381
01:22:12.430 --> 01:22:14.270
Please don't be mad.

1382
01:22:17.850 --> 01:22:19.990
- Sweetie.  - We're not mad.

1383
01:22:21.520 --> 01:22:25.080
You know what? I miss Minnesota too.

1384
01:22:26.730 --> 01:22:29.360
I miss the woods where we took hikes.

1385
01:22:30.280 --> 01:22:32.710
And the backyard where you used to play.

1386
01:22:33.530 --> 01:22:36.370
Spring Lake, where you learned to skate.

1387
01:22:38.540 --> 01:22:39.760
Come here.

1388
01:24:00.950 --> 01:24:02.660
Hey, I'm liking this new view.

1389
01:24:02.700 --> 01:24:04.210
Friendship Island has expanded.

1390
01:24:04.250 --> 01:24:06.890
Glad they finally opened that friendly argument section.

1391
01:24:06.920 --> 01:24:09.180
I like Tragic Vampire Romance Island.

1392
01:24:09.210 --> 01:24:11.890
Fashion Island? Everyone shut up.

1393
01:24:11.920 --> 01:24:14.220
Boy Band Island? Hope that's just a phase.

1394
01:24:14.260 --> 01:24:18.010
Say what you want, I think it's all beautiful.

1395
01:24:18.010 --> 01:24:19.600
All right. Here you go.

1396
01:24:19.640 --> 01:24:22.280
Your new expanded console is up and runnin'.

1397
01:24:24.140 --> 01:24:25.810
Cool! Upgrade!

1398
01:24:25.810 --> 01:24:27.910
Hey! Whoops, wait. Did I just do that?

1399
01:24:29.310 --> 01:24:30.780
Hey, guys? What's pub-er-ty?

1400
01:24:30.810 --> 01:24:33.070
I don't know. It's probably not important.

1401
01:24:33.110 --> 01:24:36.820
I have access to the entire curse word library!

1402
01:24:36.820 --> 01:24:39.030
This new console is the...

1403
01:24:40.030 --> 01:24:41.620
Sorry. I did it again. My bad.

1404
01:24:41.660 --> 01:24:42.710
They're getting to the rink.

1405
01:24:44.660 --> 01:24:46.380
Now when you get out there, you be aggressive!

1406
01:24:46.410 --> 01:24:48.130
- I know, dad.  - But not too aggressive.

1407
01:24:48.170 --> 01:24:50.970
You know, you guys don't have to come to every game.

1408
01:24:51.000 --> 01:24:54.040
Are you kidding? I'm not missing one! Go Foghorns!

1409
01:24:54.050 --> 01:24:58.610
- Go Riley! Foghorns are the best!  - Okay! I got to go!

1410
01:24:58.630 --> 01:24:59.930
They love us.

1411
01:24:59.970 --> 01:25:01.610
Yeah, mom and dad are pretty cool.

1412
01:25:01.640 --> 01:25:04.150
Guys, of course they are. But we can't show it.

1413
01:25:06.350 --> 01:25:07.980
She loved the face painting!

1414
01:25:08.020 --> 01:25:09.070
Told you it was a great idea!

1415
01:25:10.270 --> 01:25:13.570
- Best idea he's had in a while.  - He's a really good guy.

1416
01:25:18.320 --> 01:25:19.580
Just in case.

1417
01:25:22.620 --> 01:25:23.670
Sorry.

1418
01:25:26.580 --> 01:25:30.760
Girl! Girl! Girl!

1419
01:25:33.380 --> 01:25:36.270
Okay. Bye.

1420
01:25:40.260 --> 01:25:43.070
- Go, Riley!  - You got this!

1421
01:25:45.060 --> 01:25:47.220
- You ready?  - Yeah.

1422
01:25:47.220 --> 01:25:49.440
All right. Let's play some hockey!

1423
01:25:50.940 --> 01:25:51.990
All right, Anger, take it!

1424
01:25:52.020 --> 01:25:53.230
Give us that puck or you're dead meat!

1425
01:25:53.230 --> 01:25:54.280
On our left. On our left!

1426
01:25:54.310 --> 01:25:56.110
Let's just try not to get all smelly this time.

1427
01:25:56.150 --> 01:25:58.280
Mom and dad are watching us fail.

1428
01:25:58.320 --> 01:25:59.790
Not for long!

1429
01:26:01.110 --> 01:26:03.160
We've been through a lot lately, that's for sure.

1430
01:26:03.200 --> 01:26:05.210
But we still love our girl.

1431
01:26:05.240 --> 01:26:07.870
She has great new friends, a great new house.

1432
01:26:07.910 --> 01:26:09.380
Things couldn't be better.

1433
01:26:09.410 --> 01:26:13.750
After all, Riley's twelve now. What could happen?

1434
01:26:34.270 --> 01:26:37.610
And who can tell me what year San Francisco was founded?

1435
01:26:37.610 --> 01:26:39.670
Anyone? Jordan?

1436
01:26:42.320 --> 01:26:43.650
How much more of this?

1437
01:26:43.660 --> 01:26:47.340
Five months, two weeks and four days until Summer Vacation.

1438
01:26:47.370 --> 01:26:51.050
Then it's off to the Bahamas with you know who!

1439
01:26:51.080 --> 01:26:54.090
Come fly with me, Gatinha.

1440
01:26:57.790 --> 01:26:59.470
Have a nice day.

1441
01:27:00.460 --> 01:27:01.720
What are we mad about?

1442
01:27:01.760 --> 01:27:03.670
I don't know. Whatever Troy's mad about.

1443
01:27:03.680 --> 01:27:06.440
- What's Troy mad about?  - I don't know.

1444
01:27:07.140 --> 01:27:08.570
I know. Totally.

1445
01:27:09.470 --> 01:27:12.060
We're a total fraud! Do you think they can see through us?

1446
01:27:12.100 --> 01:27:13.980
Of course not! We're wearing eye shadow!

1447
01:27:13.980 --> 01:27:16.240
Being cool is so exhausting.

1448
01:27:16.770 --> 01:27:21.860
Who's the birthday girl? Hey! Hello?

1449
01:27:23.570 --> 01:27:27.410
Six years of drama school for this?

1450
01:27:27.450 --> 01:27:28.920
Move it, will you?

1451
01:27:31.580 --> 01:27:33.470
What are you doing? Come on!

1452
01:27:33.500 --> 01:27:35.210
You know what? This is okay. This is fine.

1453
01:27:35.210 --> 01:27:37.540
We just need to go to our happy place.

1454
01:27:37.540 --> 01:27:38.710
Tripledent Gum...

1455
01:27:38.710 --> 01:27:40.380
No! Not this again!
